# Frontend Development - Testing Workflow

## REQUIRED: Test-First Development

Every code change must follow this workflow:

### 1️⃣ Before Making Changes
```bash
npm run test -- --run
```
✅ Verify baseline - all tests pass

### 2️⃣ Write Your Code
- Implement feature or fix
- Add tests for new functionality
- Follow TypeScript/React conventions

### 3️⃣ Run Tests Immediately
```bash
npm run test -- --run
```
✅ All tests still pass
❌ If failed: fix code or update tests, then re-run

### 4️⃣ Final Verification
```bash
npm run test -- --run && npm run type-check && npm run lint && npm run build
```
All 4 must pass ✅ before committing.

