- **Test files:** `src/tests/[ComponentName].test.tsx`
- **Test setup:** `src/tests/setup.ts`
- **Test utilities:** `src/tests/test-utils.tsx`
- **API mocking:** `src/mocks/handlers.ts` (MSW handles automatically)

