## Key Testing Principles

✅ **Test user behavior** - Not implementation details
✅ **Use semantic queries** - getByRole, getByLabelText
✅ **Mock APIs** - MSW handles automatically
✅ **Test edge cases** - Errors, loading states, empty states
✅ **Keep tests focused** - One concept per test
✅ **Never skip failing tests** - Fix the root cause

---

## Code Quality Principles

✅ **Keep changes minimal** - Only modify what's necessary
✅ **One feature per commit** - Don't mix unrelated changes
✅ **No over-engineering** - Simplest solution that works
✅ **Clean code** - Readable, well-formatted, documented
✅ **No unnecessary files** - Don't create docs/configs that aren't needed
✅ **DRY principle** - Don't repeat code, reuse components/utilities
✅ **Remove dead code** - Delete unused imports, functions, files

