## Before Committing

```bash
npm run test -- --run && npm run type-check && npm run lint && npm run build
```

All must pass ✅ or commit will be blocked by pre-commit hook.

---

## Git Hook Enforcement

A pre-commit hook automatically runs tests before allowing commits. This ensures:
- Tests always pass before committing
- No regressions make it to code review
- TypeScript and linting checks pass
- Build succeeds

